room	21	56	20	0	231
name	Land of Shadow
desc	You are in a land of dark shadows and shallow hills, which stretch out in all directions. To the west, the land dips sharply.
items	
exit	NE	to	12	Land of Shadow
exit	EAST	to	19	Land of Shadow
exit	SE	to	18	Land of Shadow
