room	22	52	20	0	231
name	Land of Shadow
desc	You are standing atop a steep cliff, looking west over a vast ocean. Far below, the surf pounds at a sandy beach. To the south and east are rolling hills filled with eerie shadows. A path cut into the face of the cliff descends toward the beach. To the north is a tall stone wall, which ends at the cliff edge. It was obviously built long ago, and directly north is a spot where you could climb over the rubble of the decaying wall.
items	
exit	SOUTH	to	21	Land of Shadow
exit	EAST	to	12	Land of Shadow
exit	SE	to	19	Land of Shadow
exit	SW	to	29	Flathead Ocean
exit	WEST	to	29	Flathead Ocean
exit	NE	blocked	0	A stone wall blocks the way.
exit	NW	blocked	0	A stone wall blocks the way.
exit	DOWN	to	29	Flathead Ocean
exit	NORTH	to	13	Cliff
endroom
room	23	52	36	-1	88
name	Cliff Ledge
desc	This is a rock-strewn ledge near the base of a tall cliff. The bottom of the cliff is another fifteen feet below. You have little hope of climbing up the cliff face, but you might be able to scramble down from here (though it's doubtful you could return). A long piece of rope is dangling down from the top of the cliff and is within your reach.
items	chest
exit	UP	blocked	0	You attempt the climb but slide back down.
exit	DOWN	to	20	Cliff Base
endroom
room	24	44	68	0	231
name	Beam Room
desc	You are in the middle of a long north-south corridor whose walls are polished stone. A narrow red beam of light crosses the room at the north end, inches above the floor. The beam is blocked by a lying on the floor.
items	red beam of light
exit	NORTH	per	0	
exit	NW	per	0	
exit	NE	per	0	
exit	SOUTH	to	14	Button Room
endroom
room	25	60	52	N	240
name	Aqueduct
desc	You are in a wide stone channel, part of the water supply system for the Great Underground Empire. The source of water was a waterfall to the south, which has long since dried up. Water flowed along the aqueduct to the north. This region is lit from above, although the source of light is not apparent.
items	
exit	UP	blocked	0	The hole is too far above your head.
exit	SOUTH	blocked	0	You can't climb the dried-up waterfall.
exit	NORTH	to	15	High Arch
endroom
room	26	64	36	0	231
name	Aqueduct View
desc	This is a small balcony carved into a near-vertical cliff. To the east, stretching from north to south, stands a monumental aqueduct supported by mighty stone pillars, some of which are starting to crumble from age. You feel a sense of loss and sadness as you ponder this once-proud structure and the failure of the Empire which created this and other engineering marvels. Some stone steps lead up to the northwest.
items	
exit	NW	to	16	Lake Shore
exit	UP	to	16	Lake Shore
exit	DOWN	blocked	0	The drop would be fatal.
endroom
room	27	64	44	N	240
name	On the Lake
desc	You are floating on the surface of the lake. The water is ice cold and your ability to survive here for long is very questionable. A swim north puts you at your starting point. Conditions to the east are poor where the lake turns into swamp. The west and south shores are suitable for walking, however.
items	
exit	NORTH	to	16	Lake Shore
exit	SOUTH	to	33	Southern Shore
exit	SE	blocked	0	The swamp is impassable.
exit	EAST	blocked	0	The swamp is impassable.
exit	NE	blocked	0	The swamp is impassable.
exit	WEST	to	69	Western Shore
exit	NW	to	69	Western Shore
exit	SW	to	33	Southern Shore
exit	DOWN	to	32	Underwater
endroom
room	28	60	20	0	231
name	Land of Shadow
desc	You are near the southern end of the land of shadow. The ground here is soft and spongy, and it becomes quicksand to the south. North and east of here are gentle, rolling hills. A gentle sea breeze wafts over a steeply sloping path to the west.
items	
exit	NORTH	to	21	Land of Shadow
exit	NW	to	29	Flathead Ocean
exit	WEST	to	29	Flathead Ocean
exit	DOWN	to	29	Flathead Ocean
exit	SE	to	17	Land of Shadow
exit	EAST	to	18	Land of Shadow
exit	NE	to	19	Land of Shadow
