exit	SW	blocked	0	The quicksand prevents movement in that direction.
endroom
room	29	60	12	-1	88
name	Flathead Ocean
desc	You are at the shore of an amazing underground sea, the topic of many a legend among adventurers. Few were known to have arrived at this spot, and fewer to return. There is a heavy surf and a breeze is blowing on-shore. The land rises steeply to the east and quicksand prevents movement to the south. A thick mist covers the ocean and extends over the hills to the east. A path heads north along the beach. An ancient Viking ship is passing along the shore, an old and crusty sailor at the helm.
items	Viking Ship
exit	NORTH	to	20	Cliff Base
exit	ENTER	blocked	0	Between the rocks, wind, and waves, you wouldn't last a minute.
exit	WEST	blocked	0	Between the rocks, wind, and waves, you wouldn't last a minute.
exit	SW	blocked	0	Between the rocks, wind, and waves, you wouldn't last a minute.
exit	NW	blocked	0	Between the rocks, wind, and waves, you wouldn't last a minute.
exit	SE	to	28	Land of Shadow
exit	NE	to	22	Land of Shadow
exit	EAST	to	21	Land of Shadow
exit	SOUTH	blocked	0	The quicksand prevents movement here.
endroom
