name	Key Room
desc	You are between some rock and a dark place. The room is lit dimly from above, revealing a lone, dark path sloping down to the west. A heavy manhole cover has been moved to reveal a dark passage below. To one side of the room is a large manhole cover.
items	manhole cover|strange key
