room	32	68	36	N	240
name	Underwater
desc	You are below the surface of the lake. It turns out that the lake is quite shallow and the bottom is only a few feet below you. Considering the frigid temperature of the water, you should probably not plan an extended stay. The lake bottom is sandy and a few hearty plants and algae live there.
items	sand|plants and algae|shiny object
exit	UP	to	27	On the Lake
